 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Check the gears themselves, the cables are often last to go. Which gears slip? With the chain off, turn the gears slowly until each one slips, and note which ones. Look inside the hub for worn balls, or try re threading it. Then it' probably the cables. Loose or frayed ones slip. Pull them tight, and check the cable guide on derailleur.",
